        {
         "@type": "meaningComprehension",
         "comprehends": [
          "copies/wq296df7434.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "Faint ink on paler buff paper, five figures and nothing else. The figures themselves are legible, four cursive 2s of one pattern and a 1, but no points divide them, so the grouping is not fixed by the paper: 21.2.22 or 2.12.22. I give 21.2.22 because the two five-figure inscriptions read so far in this corpus, 14114 and 29125, both take the first two figures as the day; the year is 1922 either way."
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
